  "motif_strategy": "Ostinato motif is a five-note stepwise cell in D minor (D-E-F-E-D) with asymmetric accent on the fourth note, leaving the third beat of each bar open for dialogue. The cello counterline answers with a descending third fill, not doubling the ostinato.",
